# ERP Software — Development Environment Setup

## Project Overview

This project is an ERP platform intended for ISO/API-style audit and compliance management. The initial development environment is being built locally on Windows, with the eventual production environment planned on Google Cloud Platform (GCP).

## Development Stack

- Frontend: Next.js (planned)
- Backend: NestJS (planned)
- ORM: Prisma ORM 7.9.1
- Database: PostgreSQL 18.6
- Production Database: Google Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL (planned)
- Cloud Platform: Google Cloud Platform (planned)
- Analytics: BigQuery (planned for future analytics/reporting needs)

